# Tags for tmux sessions, shown on the right of the status bar.
#
#   <tag> [colour]: <session name> <session name> ...
#
# The colour is any tmux colour, e.g. #268bd2, green or colour208; without one
# the tag uses the status bar's default colour.
#
# Session names may be globs (DW-*) and match case-insensitively. A session
# listed under more than one tag gets all of them. Edits apply on the next
# config reload (prefix r) or when a session is created or renamed.
